# Findings recorded in the design notes that stop a fuzz run at its first hit. scripts/fuzz.sh passes this file to UBSan so that the
# run goes on to the next finding; delete the line when the fix lands (FZ_SKIP does the same for the checks of the targets themselves).
#
# F-BM25-1: sift_get_varint (unbounded decode) shifts by 70 on a corrupt blob of continuation bytes; the 64 zero bytes behind a blob end the loop
shift-base:core/varint.h
